{
  "title": "pydracor",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<p><em><strong>pydracor</strong></em> is a Python package that provides access to the API of DraCor (<a href=\"https://dracor.org/doc/api\">https://dracor.org/doc/api</a>), the Drama Corpora Platform (<a href=\"https://dracor.org\">https://dracor.org</a>). The package builds on <em>pydracor-base</em>, which is generated from the DraCor API's OpenAPI specification with OpenAPI Generator.</p>",
